        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f9434bbc-0e14-4b56-b233-5dbb4fd29012).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47,\r\rWe have tracked this manipulation attempt to 3 former Kronstadt Employees who have fled to Haven to be disappeared after realizing we could, indeed, track them.  Zach Cheng had been a Marketing Director before reports of a &quot;murderous aura&quot; resulted in his termination. Tom Evans was unfortunate enough not to get the memo about leaving the AC alone.  And Daist? Well her blatant misuse of her company laptop disabled the satellite dish.\r\rGood luck 47,\rI will leave you to prepare.",
